{
  "name": "Nestiviti - Lead Capture (Owner + Resident)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Nestiviti — Lead Capture\n\n**What this does:** Both the Owners page form and the Residents page form on the site post here. A `formType` field (`owner` or `resident`) tells this workflow which Airtable table to write to.\n\n**Wired to the real base (2026-07-28):** Base `YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID` (Nestiviti Leads), table `YOUR_OWNER_LEADS_TABLE_ID` (Owner Leads) and `YOUR_RESIDENT_LEADS_TABLE_ID` (Resident Leads).\n\n**Setup still required before this works:**\n1. Create an Airtable Personal Access Token credential in n8n named exactly `NEST - Airtable` (scopes: data.records:read + data.records:write, access to the Nestiviti Leads base).\n2. Import this JSON into the n8n instance, then open both Airtable nodes and select the `NEST - Airtable` credential from the dropdown (the credential ID in this file is a placeholder and won't auto-resolve — pick it manually once per node).\n3. Confirm both tables have these exact field names: `Owner Leads` → Name, Contact, Property Address, Submitted At, Status. `Resident Leads` → Name, Contact, Room / Move-In, Submitted At, Status.\n4. Activate the workflow. The webhook path (`nestiviti-lead`) already matches the site's `LEAD_CAPTURE_WEBHOOK` constant — no site change needed if using the same n8n instance/domain.\n\n**Sample input (POST body):**\n`{ \"formType\": \"owner\", \"name\": \"Jordan Smith\", \"contact\": \"lead@example.com\", \"detail\": \"123 Peachtree St, Atlanta, GA\" }`\n`{ \"formType\": \"resident\", \"name\": \"Alex Lee\", \"contact\": \"555-0100\", \"detail\": \"Room A, move in Aug 15\" }`\n\n**Top failure modes:**\n- Field names in Airtable don't exactly match the columns above → node errors on execution.\n- `formType` not exactly `owner` or `resident` → routed to validation error response, not silently dropped.\n- CORS: Respond to Webhook nodes set `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` as a safety net if the site lives on a different domain.\n\n**Not built:** any notification (Telegram/email) when a new lead lands — add a node after each Airtable Create if you want to be pinged per lead.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 480
      },
      "name": "Overview & Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "nestiviti-lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Lead Capture Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $json.body ?? $json;\nconst formType = (body.formType || '').toString().trim().toLowerCase();\nconst name = (body.name || '').toString().trim();\nconst contact = (body.contact || '').toString().trim();\nconst detail = (body.detail || '').toString().trim();\n\nconst validType = formType === 'owner' || formType === 'resident';\nconst valid = !!name && !!contact && validType;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    valid,\n    formType,\n    name,\n    contact,\n    detail,\n    submittedAt: new Date().toISOString(),\n    error: valid ? null : 'Please fill in your name and contact info.'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "name": "Validate Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -20,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-lead-valid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.valid }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Lead Valid?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cond-owner",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.formType }}",
                    "rightValue": "owner",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "cond-resident",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.formType }}",
                    "rightValue": "resident",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Route By Type",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        420,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "record",
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID"
        },
        "table": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_OWNER_LEADS_TABLE_ID"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Contact": "={{ $json.contact }}",
            "Property Address": "={{ $json.detail }}",
            "Submitted At": "={{ $json.submittedAt }}",
            "Status": "New"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Create Owner Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        -220
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "YOUR - Airtable"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "record",
        "operation": "create",
        "base": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_AIRTABLE_BASE_ID"
        },
        "table": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "YOUR_RESIDENT_LEADS_TABLE_ID"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Name": "={{ $json.name }}",
            "Contact": "={{ $json.contact }}",
            "Room / Move-In": "={{ $json.detail }}",
            "Submitted At": "={{ $json.submittedAt }}",
            "Status": "New"
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Create Resident Lead",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        20
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "YOUR - Airtable"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ success: true, message: \"Thanks — we'll be in touch soon.\" }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              },
